msgstr "该成员资格的唯一标识。"

msgid "The identifier property represents any kind of identifier for any kind of Thing, such as ISBNs, GTIN codes, UUIDs etc. Schema.org provides dedicated properties for representing many of these, either as textual strings or as URL (URI) links."
msgstr "标识符属性表示任何类型事物的任何类型的标识符，例如 ISBN、GTIN 代码、UUID 等。 Schema.org 提供了用于将其中许多属性表示为文本字符串或 URL (URI) 链接的专用属性。"

msgid "An additional type for the item, typically used for adding more specific types from external vocabularies in microdata syntax. This is a relationship between something and a class that the thing is in."
msgstr "该项的其他类型，通常用于在微数据语法中添加来自外部词汇表的其他特定类型。 这是某项与其所在类之间的关系。"

msgid "disambiguatingDescription"
msgstr "disambiguatingDescription"

msgid "A sub property of description. A short description of the item used to disambiguate from other, similar items. Information from other properties (in particular, name) may be necessary for the description to be useful for disambiguation."
msgstr "描述的子属性。 用于将该项与其他类似项区分开的简短描述。 用于区分的描述可能需要来自其他属性（特别是 name）的信息。"

msgid "If this is the main content of the page, provide url of the page."
msgstr "如果这是页面的主要内容，请提供页面的 URL。"

msgid "URL of the item."
msgstr "该项的 URL。"

msgid "Url linked to the web site, such as wikipedia page or social profiles. Multiple values may be used, separated by a comma."
msgstr "链接到 Web 站点的 URL，例如，Wikipedia 页面或社交个人档案。 可以使用多个值（用逗号分隔）。"

msgid "hostingOrganization"
msgstr "hostingOrganization"

msgid "The organization (airline, travelers' club, etc.) the membership is made with."
msgstr "会员所在的组织 （航空公司、旅行者俱乐部等）。"

msgid "member"
msgstr "成员"

msgid "A member of an Organization or a ProgramMembership. Organizations can be members of organizations; ProgramMembership is typically for individuals."
msgstr "组织的成员或 ProgramMembership。 一些组织可以是另一些组织的成员；ProgramMembership 通常适用于个人。"

msgid "QuantitativeValue"
msgstr "QuantitativeValue"

msgid "The value."
msgstr "值。"

msgid "minValue"
msgstr "minValue"

msgid "The minimum value."
msgstr "最小值。"

msgid "maxValue"
msgstr "maxValue"

msgid "The maximum value."
msgstr "最大值。"

msgid "unitText"
msgstr "unitText"

msgid "The unit of the value, like HOUR, DAY, WEEK, MONTH, or YEAR."
msgstr "值的单位，例如，HOUR、DAY、WEEK、MONTH 或 YEAR。"

msgid "Question"
msgstr "问题"

msgid "RECOMMENDED BY GOOGLE. The full text of the long form of the question."
msgstr "GOOGLE 推荐。 问题的详细形式的完整文本。"

msgid "RECOMMENDED BY GOOGLE. The total number of votes that this question has received."
msgstr "GOOGLE 推荐。 此问题已收到的投票总数。"

msgid "answerCount"
msgstr "answerCount"

msgid "REQUIRED BY GOOGLE. The total number of answers to the question. This may also be 0 for questions with no answers."
msgstr "GOOGLE 必需。 问题的答案总数。 对于没有答案的问题，这也可能为 0。"

msgid "RECOMMENDED BY GOOGLE. The date at which the question was added to the page, in ISO-8601 format."
msgstr "GOOGLE 推荐。 将问题添加到页面的日期，采用 ISO-8601 格式。"

msgid "acceptedAnswer"
msgstr "acceptedAnswer"

msgid "A top answer to the question. There can be zero or more of these per question. Either acceptedAnswer OR suggestedAnswer is REQUIRED BY GOOGLE."
msgstr "问题的最重要答案。 每个问题可以有零个或多个答案。 Google 需要 acceptedAnswer 或 suggestedAnswer。"

msgid "suggestedAnswer"
msgstr "suggestedAnswer"

msgid "One possible answer, but not accepted as a top answer (acceptedAnswer). There can be zero or more of these per Question. Either acceptedAnswer OR suggestedAnswer is REQUIRED BY GOOGLE."
msgstr "一个可能的答案，但未被接受为顶级答案 (acceptedAnswer)。 每个问题可以有零个或多个答案。 Google 需要 acceptedAnswer 或 suggestedAnswer。"

msgid "RECOMMENDED BY GOOGLE. The author of the question."
msgstr "GOOGLE 推荐。 问题的作者。"

msgid "Rating"
msgstr "评级"

msgid "Review"
msgstr "评论"

msgid "The actual body of the review."
msgstr "该评论的实际正文。"

msgid "The author of this review."
msgstr "评论的作者。"

msgid "The rating of this review."
msgstr "评论的评级。"

msgid "SpeakableSpecification"
msgstr "SpeakableSpecification"

msgid "xpath"
msgstr "xpath"

msgid "cssSelector"
msgstr "cssSelector"

msgid "Thing"
msgstr "事物"

msgid "Globally unique @id of the thing, usually a url, used to to link other properties to this object."
msgstr "该事项的全局唯一 @id（通常为 URL），用于将其他属性链接到此对象。"

msgid "Name of the thing."
msgstr "该事项的名称。"

msgid "Absolute URL of the canonical Web page for the thing."
msgstr "该事项的标准 Web 页面的绝对 URL。"

msgid "Select"
msgstr "选择"

msgid "URL"
msgstr "URL"

msgid "WebPageElement"
msgstr "WebPageElement"

msgid "True or False, whether this element is accessible for free."
msgstr "True 或 False，此元素是否可免费访问。"

msgid "List of class names of the parts of the web page that are not free, i.e. '.first-class', '.second-class'. Do NOT surround class names with quotation marks!"
msgstr "web 页面中非免费部分的类名列表，即，'.first-class', '.second-class'.。 不要将类名括在引号中！"

